{"notes":["## Summary\nSpike harness membuktikan AC1-5 secara isolasi dengan benar: artifact.Package -\u003e Negotiate -\u003e LocalFSTransport (tmp+rename+fsync) -\u003e Coordinator.Install -\u003e Verify-before-trust gate -\u003e Activate (only-one-active via ActiveReleaseInvariant) -\u003e status -\u003e Rollback, plus audit trail. Tes 9/9, go vet \u0026 eka validate PASS, evidence lengkap (e2e.log, verify.log, status_*.json, audit.log, summary.json). Tidak ada critical blocker. Verdict: Approve with minor changes - temuan medium/low wajib fix sebelum naik ke prod deploy path.","## Findings (severity-ranked)\n### M1 [reliability] transport_mock.go:99-120 Deliver() - tmp leak on injected failure\n- Problem: FailAtByte branch Close lalu return tanpa os.Remove(tmpPath). Sukses/partial-write cleanup benar, inject-failure tidak.\n- Why: Orphan .tmp.* tertinggal, bisa isi disk pada retry, langgar atomic contract.\n- Fix: dstTmp.Close(); os.Remove(tmpPath); return TransportError.","### M2 [reliability] transport_mock.go:144-159 - missing directory fsync after rename\n- Problem: Sync tmp lalu Rename tanpa fsync parent dir.\n- Why: Rename belum durable crash (ext4/NFS). Pattern akan dicopy ke prod SSH transport.\n- Fix: f, _ := os.Open(RemoteDir); f.Sync(); f.Close() setelah Rename. Reuse spike1 SimulatedTransport.","### M3 [correctness] harness.go:483-504 createDummyFile + 267 SizeMB default - non-deterministic identity\n- Problem: crypto/rand membuat artifact_id random tiap RunE2E walau sourceContent sama.\n- Why: AC1 identity-from-content jadi tidak reproducible; checksum ikut random.\n- Fix: PRNG seeded dari hash(sourceContent+version) atau deterministic pattern only.","### M4 [correctness] verifier.go:115-130 TamperArtifact - negative test tidak cover checksum path\n- Problem: Bitflip tengah file merusak tar header -\u003e hanya trigger Manifest presence FAIL, bukan Checksum mismatch.\n- Why: 6 checks punya path checksum/immutability untuk tamper halus; test tidak buktikan.\n- Fix: Tambah helper TamperContentPreservingArchive (extract ubah app/index.php re-tar tanpa update manifest) dan assert checksum mismatch.","### M5 [reliability] audit.go:49-85 + harness.go:285,222 - silent audit failure\n- Problem: NewAuditLogger ignore MkdirAll error; caller audit,_ := NewAuditLogger dan _,_= audit.Log.\n- Why: Jika disk full/permission, deploy sukses tanpa jejak audit melanggar AC5.\n- Fix: Propagasi error, cek err Log minimal log ke harness Logger.","### M6 [maintainability] mock_target.go:38-52 - MockTarget terlalu permissive\n- Problem: PASS untuk MinVersion != \"\" apapun.\n- Why: Negotiate PASS jadi vacuous, tidak catch bug version kosong.\n- Fix: Validasi semver, tambah test NegotiateFail version kosong, dokumentasi mock limit.","### L1 [reliability] audit.go RedactUser inconsistency\n- Problem: RedactUser hanya filter private/deploy_ssh_key, tidak filter id_rsa/.pem.\n- Fix: Centralize ke RedactSecrets untuk user/remotePath/details.","### L2 [maintainability] audit.go + summary.json - empty artifact_id pada verify/activate/rollback\n- Problem: Audit verify/activate kosongkan artifact_id, summary ManifestJSON base64.\n- Fix: Isi artifact_id dari manifest di VerifiedActivate; marshal ManifestJSON sebagai json.RawMessage.","### L3 [reliability] harness.go triple verify\n- Problem: Verify dipanggil 3x berurutan untuk artifact1 (BuildArtifact+Verify1+VerifyBeforeTrust).\n- Fix: Cache VerificationResult atau dokumentasikan defence-in-depth.","### L4 [maintainability] cmd/spike/main.go MultiWriter duplication\n- Problem: mw = MultiWriter(stdout,e2eFile,verifyFile) duplikasi verify block di kedua log.\n- Fix: Pisah logger verify terpisah.","## Checklist AC\n- AC1 artifact.Package + VerifyArtifact + ValidateManifestSchema PASS, identity-from-content tested (SizeMB=0), evidence artifact1.json valid.\n- AC2 Negotiate + LocalFSTransport atomic rename + Install PASS, throughput sim, failure classification ok.\n- AC3 Verify-before-trust gate PASS, negative tamper rejected (Activate \u0026 Install), TOCTOU covered di coordinator verifyStoredArtifact.\n- AC4 only-one-active via ActiveReleaseInvariant (archived), status observable via QueryLifecycleStatus/GetActiveRelease/ListReleases, rollback restores previous (stage active \u003c- archived, rolled back).\n- AC5 audit.log JSON-lines durable (Sync per entry), who+timestamp logged, secret redaction tested (no DEPLOY_SSH_KEY leak).\n- Evidence logs lengkap dan konsisten dengan summary.json.","## Positive Notes\n- Penggunaan artifact.Package sesuai ADR-004 (content-derived identity + checksum), manifest schema validation eksplisit, evidence 6-check PASS.\n- Transport atomic tmp+Sync+Rename benar, filepath.Base sanitization cegah traversal.\n- Verify-before-trust gate terpisah VerifiedActivate, teruji positive \u0026 negative, coordinator Install juga RequireVerified + verifyStoredArtifact (TD-009).\n- Only-one-active invariant dan rollback first-class via release state machine terbukti di evidence status_*.json.\n- Audit durability per-entry Sync dan redaction SanitizeLogLine.","## Recommendation\nApprove with minor changes. Tidak ada critical/high blocker untuk spike. Wajib fix M1-M6 sebelum promosi ke prod `anvil deploy` (terutama dir fsync, tmp cleanup, deterministic payload, checksum negative test, audit error propagation). Low findings bisa follow-up."],"role":"review","verdict":"approve"}